    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PST202 · Assessment 6/8</span>\n<h2>Lab1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13365 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PST202 · Đầu điểm 6/8</span>\n<h2>Lab1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13365 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">5.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">150' in class</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Take photographs, find and analyze the perspective elements in the photographs, like vanishing point, eyes level, vanishing point of specical lines. Explain why appearance differs from reality theory.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">- Knowledge: Understand the basic rules, concept of perspective. Understand why appearance differs from reality theory, understand concept of Vanishing points and eyes level, how to find vanishing point, eyes level on the picture plane, vanishing point of specical lines.<br>- Skills: Analyze pictures for perspective fundamentals and basic concepts</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">1. Students take a number of photographs following instruction in the area. Students may use AI generated pictures or existing pictures for reference. Discuss with the instrcutor about the relevance of the photographs taken.<br>2. Students choose suitable pictures and analyze the perspective elements in the photographs, edit and highline the perspective elements using digital drawing tools like Adobe Illustrator.<br>3. Combine unedited and edited pictures into a report.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Submission Files:<br>- Final document including the original photographs, analyzed photographs, and additional analysis if needed.<br>- Original drawing files if required (PDF).<br>In-class work:<br>- Peer and instructor feedback on photographs and analysis drawing.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 5 — Lab1:</li><li>Session 6 — Lab1:</li><li>Session 7 — Lab1: (Cont.)</li><li>Session 8 — Lab1: (Cont.)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 5 — Lab1:</li><li>Buổi 6 — Lab1:</li><li>Buổi 7 — Lab1: (Cont.)</li><li>Buổi 8 — Lab1: (Cont.)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=PST202\">Exam Room — PST202</a> (4 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=PST202\">Phòng thi — PST202</a> (4 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
